[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13500.71, "timestamp": "03:45:00", "text": "学日语的时候，我就觉得，我做不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13504.03, "timestamp": "03:45:04", "text": "这。而我却拖延了很久。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13506.07, "timestamp": "03:45:06", "text": "拖延。上帝抓住了他。这样一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13510.63, "timestamp": "03:45:10", "text": "呃，该怎么称呼它？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13520.75, "timestamp": "03:45:20", "text": "上帝。你好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13524.95, "timestamp": "03:45:24", "text": "鲁弗斯。没有里克。你好。我刚才是不是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13527.59, "timestamp": "03:45:27", "text": "不小心叫你鲁弗斯了？对不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13533.06, "timestamp": "03:45:33", "text": "姓名。你好，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13537.79, "timestamp": "03:45:37", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13541.11, "timestamp": "03:45:41", "text": "罗克珊。你的名字该怎么念？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13542.469, "timestamp": "03:45:42", "text": "我想我一直以来都是这么念的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13546.269, "timestamp": "03:45:46", "text": "每次都不一样。你好，好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13554.59, "timestamp": "03:45:54", "text": "真的，呃，我正坐在椅子上摇晃呢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13559.07, "timestamp": "03:45:59", "text": "现在努力保持清醒"}]